{"id":"9a0fa730-fb5f-447d-82ae-1640700c0ae6","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"a67c37d356873017","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/worker/state.ts","baseline":{"blob":"7d713878eed505876a86ee4a1ecd569503e5df4a","start":4100,"end":4144},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","editorLink","\"",":","RuntimeConnection","|","undefined",";"]},"context":{"before":"0c97377b8ef10d67#0","after":"5ffc0321e63bcab7"}},"payload":{"text":"This worker's link into the editor's runtime (editor-api's workspace runtime), the port the adapter hands over\nfirst thing: a server the program starts answers through it, and its log and spans — a step's, its uncaught\nerrors, its own requests — are the editor's, as this worker's (the top page's timeline, debug-mcp). The debug\nprotocol itself is the adapter's and this worker's own: their messages (debug-protocol.ts' ToWorker / WorkerEvent).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:01:38.949Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:01:38.949Z"}
{"id":"ae14c0de-a410-4932-9b8d-3e513077a199","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"88a44add8aaa4ded","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/worker/state.ts","baseline":{"blob":"82f3a66721591a51ef99ec45909ba39a751bcead","start":3183,"end":3258},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","interface","TraceContext","{","\"","traceId","\"",":","string",";","\"","parentSpanId","\"",":","string","}"]},"context":{"before":"6ccf4735cf31b840","after":"f9e7c3578e2ef93f"}},"payload":{"text":"A span's cross-context trace context: the hub envelope of a control message that triggers work carries the\nadapter action's, so this worker's span continues the adapter's trace (see continueSpan).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:01:46.215Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:01:46.215Z"}
