{"id":"ba42bff9-5a56-45d9-b6cb-fa013433375b","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3d3b1db177cf353c","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/worker/state.ts","baseline":{"blob":"50abc012d2eb5ec253567bf7528465ee8b071041","start":0,"end":67},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","FsShim",",","RunGlobal","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/almostnode","\""]},"context":{"after":"62454e2d36c6e442"}},"payload":{"text":"What the debug worker's modules share: its link into the editor, its log and its events to the adapter, the program\nand its breakpoints, the machine running and its history of stops — and, on `state`, what more than one module\nassigns. (A module can't assign another's `let`, so those are one object's properties.)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:01:55.513Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:01:55.513Z"}
{"id":"bb7ce5ca-d625-48c3-a552-8cd37f682555","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"ffb8685108392002","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/worker/state.ts","baseline":{"blob":"10581949c89b8d49285dbdd32223d0ccdd6945d8","start":9841,"end":9877},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","programFunctions","\"",":","WeakSet","<","object",">",";"]},"context":{"before":"cba8494d0ac9bae2","after":"52861c7ef0e156ee"}},"payload":{"text":"The functions the program was given — its built-in modules (node:fs and the rest, the capability stand-ins among them)\nand globals, two levels into each (`fs.promises.mkdir`): what a capability stop's call has to be one of to be one\n(lineReaches). Set as a run starts.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:00:50.208Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:00:50.208Z"}
{"id":"bd704d2a-582f-4a89-bb49-83bea5f989d4","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"cba8494d0ac9bae2","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/worker/state.ts","baseline":{"blob":"5ed50cb1c33f819fef5a735a8db420256017b1c9","start":9552,"end":9642},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","probing","\"",":","{","\"","capability","\"",":","string",";","\"","argIndex","\"","?",":","number",";","\"","resource","\"","?",":","string","}","|","undefined",";"]},"context":{"before":"cee89f44c0f83edd","after":"ffb8685108392002"}},"payload":{"text":"A probe running (probeResource): the capability whose call it's after, at which of its arguments (a copy's or a\nrename's second is where it lands), and the resource that call reached.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:00:52.048Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:00:52.048Z"}
{"id":"c0e1459b-330e-48b7-a5c9-d3103346dec5","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"627a613ffa82e3bf","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/tsval/worker/state.ts","baseline":{"blob":"d916988fd9d43793087b48ce6ab6f1125d7d75e5","start":5360,"end":5410},"shape":{"type":"PropertySignature","atoms":["\"","placeSets","\"",":","Map","<","string",",","Map","<","number",",","PlaceSet","[]",">",">",";"]},"context":{"before":"ec2fd80021679e63","after":"f0003962631e93fb"}},"payload":{"text":"What rules placed in the code set, once the statement on the line's run: by file and 1-based line (bridge/placed-rules.ts).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T18:01:31.518Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T18:01:31.518Z"}
